  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Critical Minerals Management for Sustainability (MAKMUR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build the capacity and political support required to implement policies, regulations and voluntary actions for a resilient and sustainable critical minerals supply chain in Indonesia, while enhancing domestic value addition and benefits from mineral production and battery and EV supply chains.

The focus areas are: 
- The critical minerals supply chain (with a focus on nickel), including governance and regulatory challenges and ESG risks.
- Sustainable mining practices, decarbonization, mining standards compliance.
- The impact of captive coal use in nickel processing.
- Downstream policies to increase domestic added value through responsible development of manufacturing capacity in EV and battery production</narrative>
  </description>
